    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "N\nE",
      "TO\nBEGIN\nWarm roasted nuts\nserved with your preferred\ncocktail or beverage\nAn array of hot appetizers\nincluding breaded chicken wings\nand scallops stuffed with seafood and wrapped in nori,\naccompanied by a hoisin dipping sauce\nS\nD\nA contemporary arrangement of Belgian and curly endive\nwith red oakleaf, Boston and red leaf lettuce,\nserved with a colorful garnish of hearts of palm, carrots, black olives,\nbroccoli florets and a red pepper julienne\nOffered with your choice\nof la flora Italian vinaigrette\nor Parmesan pepper dressing\nE\nFreshly baked bread, breadsticks,\nassorted rolls, lahosh bread and butter\nPTION\nIf you should prefer more time to work or relax,\nwe suggest this complete meal presented all at once,\nwhenever you wish.\nTender shrimp served chilled\nwith a tabouli and angel hair pasta salad\non a bed of red oakleaf lettuce and radicchio leaves\nCocktail sauce\nFresh fruit offered with\nBrie, aged cheddar cheese and cheese crackers\nStrawberry shortcake\n2811.41\n11/93\n2\nE\nThe Chef's Preference\nNew York Strip Steak au Poivre\nSterling Silver™ premium choice beef\nlightly coated with cracked black peppercorns\nand presented with pepper steak sauce\nViennese onions Buttered broccoli\nStar potatoes\nGrilled Chicken\nBoneless breast of free-range chicken\ncomplemented by a pineapple and pepper coulis\nZucchini boat with a medley of vegetables\nSpinach linguine\nSalmon Cajun-style\nCenter cut fillet of salmon\ntopped with a shrimp étouffée sauce\nSliced zucchini Shiitake mushrooms\nBrown and wild rice medley\nLighter Fare\nTender shrimp served chilled\nwith a tabouli and angel hair pasta salad\non a bed of red oakleaf lettuce and radicchio leaves\nCocktail sauce\nFR\nSelect cheeses offered with seedless grapes,\naccompanied by assorted cheese crackers,\nserved with aged port wine\nT\nHazelnut ice cream and pineapple sherbet gâteau\nATION\nL\nFreshly brewed coffee with a splash of your favorite liqueur\ntopped with whipped cream\nItaliano with Amaretto Royal with Cognac\nFrançais with Grand Marnier\nMexican with Kablúa Scottish with Drambuie\nIrish with Baileys Irish Cream\nPremium international and herbal teas\nHot chocolate\nWe apologize if occasionally your choice is not available\n2811-4\n11/93\n3"
    ],
